+Graph: PLAN -> MOCK IMPLEMENT -> (VERIFY || CLAUDE REVIEW || CODEX REVIEW || SECURITY REVIEW || UX REVIEW || UI REVIEW) -> root GATE -> FIX PROBE -> root SMOKE_TEST_PASS.
